{"sourceUrl":"https://ccst.jlu.edu.cn/info/1229/21178.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:15.221261+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://ccst.jlu.edu.cn/info/1229/21178.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span><span>根据《吉林大学</span></span><span>202</span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>推荐免试攻读研究生</span></span><span><span>招生</span></span><span><span>录取工作办法》文件要求，为确保接收推免生的复试录取工作规范有序，结合计算机科学与技术学院的实际情况，制定</span></span><span>202</span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>计算机科学与技术学院接收推荐免试研究生复试录取工作办法。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>一、复试条件</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>1、符合吉林大学</span></span><span><span>202</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>接收推荐免试研究生的基本条件，且本科专业为计算机、软件、电子、通信、数学。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2、</span></span><span><span>202</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>推荐免试硕士研究生原则上按照《吉林大学</span><span>2027年接收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生招生简章及专业目录》中规定的招生计划进行录取。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3、★参加202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年吉林大学计算机科学与技术学院</span></span><span><span>学术活动开放日考核合格考生</span></span><span><span>，经预推免报名，资格审核合格，</span></span><span><span>免复试</span></span><span><span>接收为吉林大学</span><span>“推免生”。未按时报名者，视为放弃录取资格。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>★申报我院</span></span><span><span>推免生的其他</span></span><span><span>校内外</span></span><span><span>考</span></span><span><span>生（除</span></span><span><span>专项</span></span><span><span>计划推免生外），需统一参加所有复试环节。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>二、推免预报名</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>推免生（</span></span><span><span>不</span></span><span><span>含</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年吉林大学计算机科学与技术学院</span></span><span><span>学术活动开放日合格考生</span></span><span><span>）通过我校</span></span><strong><span><span>“推免生预报名系统”</span></span></strong><span><span>（网址为</span></span><a href=\"https://yzb.jlu.edu.cn/）%20如实填写报名信息，报名截至时间为2023年9\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><span><span>https://yzb.jlu.edu.cn/</span></span></strong><span><span>）</span> <span>如实填写报名信息，报名截至时间为</span><span>2</span></span><span>02</span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>9</span></span></a><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>17</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span>:</span></span><span>00</span><span><span>。</span></span><strong><span><span>只接收第一志愿报考我院的推荐免试研究生。</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>三、复试资格审查</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>推免生提供如下</span><span>1-</span></span><span>5</span><span><span>项材料</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><strong><span><span>现场审核</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><a href=\"https://ccst.jlu.edu.cn/info/1229/21178.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span>开放日合格考生</span></span></span><span><span><span>请将相关材料扫描件</span></span></span><span><span><span>压缩命名为</span></span></span><span><span><span>报考专业</span><span>+姓名+本科所在院校</span></span></span><span><span><span>，</span><span>9月16日9:00前</span></span></span><span><span><span>发</span></span></span><span><span><span>送</span></span></span><span><span><span>至</span></span></span><span><span><span>2484539796@qq.com </span></span></span></a><span><span>，</span></span><strong><span><span>无需现场审核</span></span></strong><span><span>）</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1.《吉林大学</span></span><span><span>202</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>接收推荐免试研究生申请表》（见附件</span><span>1）。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.加盖所在学校教务部门公章的本科期间成绩单。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3.在校期间发表的论文、获得专利的证书、研究成果证明、获奖证书、外语水平考试证书以及长期有效第二代居民身份证等材料。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4.申请直博生须提交两名所报考学科专业领域内的教授(或相当专业技术职称的专家)的书面推荐意见（见附件2）。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>5</span></span><span>.</span> <span><span>第二代居民身份证和每学期均参加注册的学生证。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>学院资格审查小组对推免生的申请材料进行审查，资格审查不合格者取消复试和录取资格。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>6、体检</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>考生体检工作在新生报到后组织进行。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>四、复试方式和内容</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1</span><span><span>、笔试（</span><span>100分）</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>《算法设计综合》</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>主要测试专业素质和能力：包括推免生对本科理论知识和应用技能掌握程度，利用所学理论发现、分析和解决问题的能力，对本学科发展动态的了解以及在本专业领域发展的能力；创新精神和创新能力。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2、面试（100分）</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>主要考核综合素质和能力：包括思想政治素质和道德品质；本学科（专业）以外的学习、科研、社会实践或实际工作表现等方面的情况；事业心、责任感、纪律性（遵纪守法）、协作性和心理健康情况；人文素养；举止、表达和礼仪等；</span></span><span><span>外语</span></span><span><span>听说能力和</span></span><span><span>水平等</span></span><span><span>几</span></span><span><span>个方面。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>3</span><span><span>、上机（</span><span>1</span></span><span>00</span><span><span>分）</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>主要考核推免生对专业知识的应用、实践经验以及程序设计能力。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>五、复试安排</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>★</span></span> <span><span>资格审核：</span><span>9月</span></span><span><span>20</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>★ 专业课笔试《算法设计综合》</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>时间：</span><span>9月</span></span><span><span>20</span></span><span><span>日，上午</span></span><span>8</span><span><span>:</span></span><span>30</span><span><span>-</span></span><span>1</span><span><span>0:</span></span><span>30</span><span><span>，</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>地点：</span></span><span><span>三教一阶</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>★ 综合面试</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>时间：</span><span>9月</span></span><span><span>20</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>下</span></span><span><span>午</span></span><span><span>13</span></span><span><span>：</span><span>3</span></span><span>0</span><span><span>开始</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>地点：计算机楼</span></span><span>B4</span><span><span>01等</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>★上机考核：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>时间：</span><span>9月</span></span><span><span>20</span></span><span><span>日，</span></span><span><span>晚上</span><span>18</span></span><span><span>:</span></span><span><span>0</span></span><span>0</span><span><span>-</span></span><span><span>20</span></span><span><span>:</span></span><span><span>0</span></span><span>0</span><span><span>，</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>地点：王湘浩楼</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>六、复试成绩及录取</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>1．复试的笔试、面试、</span></span><span><span>上机测试及格线均为</span></span><span>60</span><span><span>分，</span></span><span><span>未达到及格线的推免生不予录取。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2．复试总成绩满分1</span></span><span>00</span><span><span>分，总成绩</span><span>=（笔试成绩+面试成绩+上机成绩）/</span></span><span>3</span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>3</span><span><span>．拟录取推免生根据报考专业接收名额严格按照复试成绩由高到低择优录取。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>4</span><span><span>．思想政治素质和道德品质考核不合格者不予录取。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>5．拟录取推免生请通过“全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开暨管理服务系统”（</span></span><a href=\"https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm/</span></span></a><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>报名，并且于</span></span><span><span>9月2</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>接收复试通知，</span><span>9月24日接收</span></span><span><span>待录取通知</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>完成网上</span><span>“同意待录取”确认。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>七、其它说明</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>1．</span></span><span><span>考生</span></span><span><span>参加复试时必须携带学生证和身份证。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2</span><span><span>．</span></span><span><span>申报吉林大学计算机科学与技术学院</span></span><span><span>202</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>推荐免试研究生的同学请加入</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>级</span><span>CCST硕士</span></span><span><span>QQ</span></span><span><span>群：</span><span>567849746</span></span><span><span>或</span></span><span><span>1028730269</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>咨询及申述电话：</span><span>0431-85166495 </span></span> <strong> </strong></p>\n<p><span><span>联</span> <span>系</span> <span>人：钟老师</span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"12e99d5723403738b63e5a4e03d44286a2b64be63656394b491507408555aac3","textLength":1651,"sourceSha256":"d46a50ef37ac301841a202304ec36b5c149615203daed5e22b3e552acf2c7154","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[{"name":"附件1 吉林大学2027年接收推荐免试研究生申请表.docx","url":"https://ccst.jlu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1840203934&wbfileid=18197312"},{"name":"附件2 吉林大学2027年接收优秀应届本科毕业生直接攻读博士研究生专家推荐书.docx","url":"https://ccst.jlu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1840203934&wbfileid=18197313"}],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-d7f1385494fc44db1442","title":"2026年吉林大学计算机科学与技术学院接收推荐免试攻读硕士学位研究生复试录取实施细则","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:15.221261+00:00"}
